---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import OrderForm from '../components/OrderForm.astro';
---

<Layout title="Crea tu arreglo — Frisson">
  <section class="page-intro wrap mx-auto w-11/12 max-w-7xl text-center pt-20 pb-8 [&_h1]:text-8xl [&_h1]:mb-7 [&_>_p:not(.eyebrow)]:text-sm [&_>_p:not(.eyebrow)]:leading-loose [&_>_p:not(.eyebrow)]:text-muted [&_.button]:mt-5 max-xl:w-11/12 max-lg:w-11/12 max-sm:w-11/12 max-sm:pt-14 max-sm:pb-5 max-sm:[&_h1]:text-5xl max-sm:[&_h1]:leading-none max-sm:[&_>_p:not(.eyebrow)]:text-sm">
    <p class="eyebrow text-xs font-medium tracking-widest leading-relaxed mb-6 text-olive max-sm:text-xs max-sm:mb-4 max-sm:tracking-widest">
      TAN ÚNICO COMO LO QUE SIENTES
    </p>
    <h1>
      Tu emoción,
      <br />
      <em>convertida en flores.</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      Imaginemos juntas una composición que cuente tu historia.
      <br />
      Tus flores, tus colores, tu manera de sentir.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="form-page wrap section mx-auto gap-24 w-11/12 max-w-7xl pt-12 pb-25 grid grid-cols-2 items-start max-xl:gap-14 max-xl:w-11/12 max-lg:py-20 max-lg:gap-9 max-lg:w-11/12 max-lg:grid-cols-2 max-sm:gap-9 max-sm:w-11/12 max-sm:pt-6 max-sm:pb-15 max-sm:flex max-sm:flex-col max-sm:[&_.order-form]:w-full">
    <aside class="form-aside py-0 sticky top-9 pr-6 pl-0 [&_img]:w-full [&_img]:h-95 [&_img]:object-contain [&_img]:bg-linear-to-b [&_img]:from-pale [&_img]:to-paper/0 [&_img]:bg-transparent [&_img]:rounded-t-full [&_img]:mb-5 [&_h2]:text-4xl [&_p]:text-sm [&_p]:text-muted max-lg:p-0 max-lg:[&_img]:h-72 max-lg:[&_h2]:text-4xl max-lg:[&_p]:text-xs max-sm:static max-sm:w-full max-sm:hidden">
      <img
        src="/images/ramo-jardin-romantico.webp"
        alt="Ramo francés con flores rosadas, melocotón y marfil"
        width="420"
        height="580"
      />
      <h2>
        Empieza con
        <br />
        <em>una emoción.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Trabajamos con composiciones artísticas de inspiración francesa. Cada
        propuesta tiene su propio equilibrio de flores, texturas y color.
      </p>
      <p class="field-note text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed mt-5 max-sm:text-xs">
        No elaboramos ramos buchones tradicionales de rosas idénticas. Podemos
        interpretar tu idea desde nuestro estilo.
      </p>
    </aside>
    <OrderForm />
  </section>
</Layout>
